<title>SWEDEN: Average yld 7.10 pct in Swedish 10-yr bond auction.</title>
<headline>Average yld 7.10 pct in Swedish 10-yr bond auction.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average accepted yield on an auction of two billion crowns of 10-year bonds was 7.10 percent, the National Debt Office said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>						Loan 1038</p>
<p>Volume issued (millions)		 1,999</p>
<p>Total bids    (millions)		 2,347</p>
<p>Number of accepted bids		     37</p>
<p>Number of bids				  46</p>
<p>Lowest yield				 7.080</p>
<p>Highest yield				7.110</p>
<p>Weighted average yield		   7.097</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
</text>
